
simout.txt log:

Info: [ nvclk=-1 nv_top . nv_top_full.cpp 634 ] Created backdoor memory mapfile: /proc/198456/fd/3

-chipargs -use_linsim_memstore -chipargs -emem_type micron_lpddr4x_jedec_4CH_2R_8GB_2133 -chipargs -linsim_memstore_lib  -chipargs -linsim_client_name kepler_fmodel -chipargs -linsim_store_name /proc/198456/fd/3


[How to send backdoor mapfile to remote devproc GPU]

1. Copy libtb500_backdoormem.so from SCSIM to devproc GPU

2. Parse simout.txt and look for line "Created backdoor memory mapfile: /proc/198456/fd/3" and extract mapfile "/proc/198456/fd/3"

3. Update devproc json file "$GPU_DEVPROC_ROOT_DIR/devproc/conf/devproc_gr102_conf_0.json" and "$GPU_DEVPROC_ROOT_DIR/devproc/conf/devproc_gr102_conf_1.json" to append -use_linsim_memstore -emem_type micron_lpddr4x_jedec_4CH_2R_8GB_2133 -linsim_memstore_lib libtb500_backdoormem.so -linsim_client_name hopper_fmodel -linsim_store_name /proc/198456/fd/3 -soc_vidmem_base=0x200000000000 at the tail of item "chipargs"




def build_appendix(mapfile: str, emem: str, lib: str, client: str) -> str:
    return (
        " -use_linsim_memstore"
        f" -emem_type {emem}"
        f" -linsim_memstore_lib {lib}"
        f" -linsim_client_name {client}"
        f" -linsim_store_name {mapfile}"
    )




